id=starlight_livelyrics_enable
name=Starlight LiveLyrics Enabler
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=Starlight Ports
description=Enables the native ColorOS lock-screen lyric page by setting la_lyric_mode=2 at boot. Flash in KernelSU/Magisk; no adb or terminal needed. Tap Action to re-apply and show the current value.
